<title>BELGIUM: EU raises 1996 beet sugar output to 16.3 mln tonne.</title>
<headline>EU raises 1996 beet sugar output to 16.3 mln tonne.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission on Thursday raised its 1996/97 beet sugar production estimate to 16.3 million tonnes, from 15.9 million tonnes on December 19.</p>
<p>Output totalled 15.6 million tonnes in 1995/96.</p>
<p>Non-quota &quot;C&quot; sugar stocks to be carried forward to 1997/98 were raised to 890,000 tonnes, from 685,000 tonnes carried forward into 1996/97.</p>
</text>
